WEBVTT

00:02.000 --> 00:03.400
No.

00:03.480 --> 00:04.880
We absolutely cannot retreat.

00:05.640 --> 00:10.560
We can be heroes and fulfill our duty but what about my sister and the heir?

00:10.640 --> 00:12.040
Brother-in-law.

00:13.640 --> 00:15.920
General Zu entrusted this important city to me.

00:16.000 --> 00:21.427
All soldiers are fighting to the death the volunteers don't even spare their lives for this land.

00:21.640 --> 00:23.000
How can I retreat?

00:23.640 --> 00:27.480
Anyone who dares speak of retreat will be executed for desertion.

00:33.040 --> 00:39.040
The Wuzhao commit their main force fighting on two fronts their center must be weak look.

00:40.520 --> 00:43.573
His command flag is on the slope to the northwest.

00:44.600 --> 00:46.840
We can strike shilang's lair.

00:49.240 --> 00:50.640
Xie Xuan, receive orders.

00:52.040 --> 00:53.360
Your general is here.

00:53.440 --> 00:57.573
I order you to hold the granaries to the death.

00:58.960 --> 00:59.680
No.

00:59.760 --> 01:03.040
If we're fighting to the death I won't be such a coward.

01:03.800 --> 01:05.160
No.

01:05.240 --> 01:11.160
The granaries absolutely cannot fall into wuzhao hands Your Highness let us do it.

01:19.720 --> 01:24.920
Your Highness I've brought all who can move here everyone is willing to follow Your Highness.

01:25.000 --> 01:30.760
Leave this to us I promise if the city falls the Wuzhao.

01:30.840 --> 01:32.720
Won't take A single grain.

01:33.600 --> 01:38.520
Willing to die for the royal army willing to advance and retreat with the royal army.

01:38.600 --> 01:43.920
Willing to die for the royal army willing to advance and retreat with the royal army.

01:45.520 --> 01:50.947
Today you all entrust your lives to me if I don't die today.

01:52.280 --> 01:53.947
I will grant you all.

01:55.160 --> 01:56.827
To return home in glory.

01:57.800 --> 02:00.320
Those who cannot fight stand on the granaries.

02:01.160 --> 02:02.560
Raise torches.

02:03.240 --> 02:04.640
If I am defeated.

02:05.680 --> 02:08.013
Light the fires and burn the granaries.

02:12.520 --> 02:15.480
Those who can fight follow me into the enemy camp.

02:30.760 --> 02:32.160
Mount up.

